# Civilian research only

Yanxi is a **public-source research briefing** tool.

- Never add SIGINT, CSE/CSIS imitation, espionage, spy-tool, classified-access, or wiretap framing in code, UI, skills, or docs.
- Do not implement unauthorized scraping, login-wall bypass, or personal targeting.
- Context cards and policy outlooks are `background` or `hypothesis` — not proven secret facts.
- Forecasts use scenarios + watchpoints + confidence; forbid “will definitely / guaranteed / secretly plans”.
- Prefer Mandarin paste workflows; **UI chrome and analyst labels are English** — Chinese appears only in the source paste and quoted excerpts.
